  "text": "Is your remote team's Slack sidebar cluttered with eighty dead project channels? Employees waste ten minutes every day hunting through zombie channels just to find active project threads. Ghost channels scatter documentation across outdated threads, causing new hires to read stale specs and instructions. Deploy a Make automation that scans channel activity weekly and auto-archives any room dormant for thirty days. Your team stays organized with zero maintenance.",
